### ================================================================
### VitalTrack SOAP API - Complete Test Suite
### Base URL (WSDL Location): http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/<ServiceName>/<ClassName>?wsdl
### Endpoint URL: http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/<ServiceName>/<ClassName>
### ================================================================
###
### IMPORTANT — AUTHENTICATION REQUIRED FOR ALL SOAP ENDPOINTS
### SOAP endpoints are protected by ApiAuthenticationFilter.
### You must obtain a JWT token first via the REST login endpoint,
### then add it as: Authorization: Bearer <your-token>
### ================================================================

### ================================================================
### STEP 1 — GET YOUR TOKEN (REST login — run this first)
### ================================================================

### [POST] Login — Get JWT Token
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hospital.com",
  "password": "Admin@1234"
}

###

### ================================================================
### STEP 2 — USE YOUR TOKEN IN EVERY REQUEST BELOW
### Replace <paste-your-token-here> in the Authorization header
### ================================================================



### ================================================================
###  EQUIPMENT SOAP ENDPOINTS
### ================================================================

### [SOAP] List All Equipment
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/EquipmentSoapService/EquipmentSoapApi
Content-Type: text/xml
Accept: text/xml
Authorization: Bearer <paste-your-token-here>

<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:soap="http://soap.app/">
   <soapenv:Header/>
   <soapenv:Body>
      <soap:list/>
   </soapenv:Body>
</soapenv:Envelope>

###

### [SOAP] Find Equipment by ID
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/EquipmentSoapService/EquipmentSoapApi
Content-Type: text/xml
Accept: text/xml
Authorization: Bearer <paste-your-token-here>

<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:soap="http://soap.app/">
   <soapenv:Header/>
   <soapenv:Body>
      <soap:find>
         <id>1</id>
      </soap:find>
   </soapenv:Body>
</soapenv:Envelope>

###

### [SOAP] Save/Register New Equipment
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/EquipmentSoapService/EquipmentSoapApi
Content-Type: text/xml
Accept: text/xml
Authorization: Bearer <paste-your-token-here>

<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:soap="http://soap.app/">
   <soapenv:Header/>
   <soapenv:Body>
      <soap:save>
         <equipment>
            <name>Philips IntelliVue MX450 Patient Monitor</name>
            <serialNumber>SN-MON-PHL-2024-007</serialNumber>
            <status>ACTIVE</status>
            <purchaseDate>2024-01-15</purchaseDate>
            <lastCalibrationDate>2025-11-01</lastCalibrationDate>
            <nextCalibrationDate>2026-05-01</nextCalibrationDate>
         </equipment>
      </soap:save>
   </soapenv:Body>
</soapenv:Envelope>

###

### [SOAP] Delete Equipment by ID (change id as needed)
POST http://localhost:8080/VitalTrack/EquipmentSoapService/EquipmentSoapApi
Content-Type: text/xml
Accept: text/xml
Authorization: Bearer <paste-your-token-here>

<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:soap="http://soap.app/">
   <soapenv:Header/>
   <soapenv:Body>
      <soap:delete>
         <id>5</id>
      </soap:delete>
   </soapenv:Body>
</soapenv:Envelope>


